{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "6c6b6a2e-2f7a-4f4b-9a3e-codeware-api-v1",
		"name": "Codeware API v1",
		"description": "Public + Admin REST API for Codeware.\n\n**Auth note:** there is no `/api/v1/login` endpoint. To get a Sanctum token for the Admin folder, either:\n1. Log in via the web Fortify session at `/login`, then hit `GET /token` (dev-only route, expires in ~5 minutes), or\n2. Run `php artisan tinker` and generate a long-lived token:\n```php\n$user = \\App\\Models\\User::where('is_admin', true)->first();\n$user->createToken('postman', ['*'])->plainTextToken;\n```\nPaste the resulting token into the `token` collection variable.\n\nAll translatable fields (`title`, `name`, `description`, `content`) use the shape `{\"en\": \"...\", \"bn\": \"...\"}`.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "base_url", "value": "https://codeware.test/api/v1", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "locale", "value": "en", "type": "string" }
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Public",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Posts",
					"item": [
						{
							"name": "List Posts",
							"request": {
								"method": "GET",
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{base_url}}/posts?locale={{locale}}&per_page=15&category=&search=",
									"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
									"path": ["posts"],
									"query": [
										{ "key": "locale", "value": "{{locale}}" },
										{ "key": "per_page", "value": "15" },
										{ "key": "category", "value": "", "description": "post category slug" },
										{ "key": "search", "value": "", "description": "matches title in the given locale" }
									]
								}
							}
						},
						{
							"name": "Get Post by Slug",
							"request": {
								"method": "GET",
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{base_url}}/posts/:slug?locale={{locale}}",
									"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
									"path": ["posts", ":slug"],
									"variable": [{ "key": "slug", "value": "hello_world" }],
									"query": [{ "key": "locale", "value": "{{locale}}" }]
								}
							}
						}
					]
				},
